(7088654, 1079559, 28427, '<td valign="top">If this is not a real arm, then the setup could be easy.<br/>But...it actually does look like a real arm... Dare I asking? :)<br/>Curious to see the comments afterwards and hoping they reveal some of the mystery of this entry</td>', 'If this is not a real arm, then the setup could be easy.But...it actually does look like a real arm... Dare I asking? :)Curious to see the comments afterwards and hoping they reveal some of the mystery of this entry', '2013-08-17 07:55:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7088655, 1079564, 28427, '<td valign="top">looks like one of them found the back door :) <br/>Nice bright colours</td>', 'looks like one of them found the back door :) Nice bright colours', '2013-08-17 07:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7088659, 1079049, 28427, '<td valign="top">Talking image, but the building''s a bit crooked and goes down hill :)<br/>A few steps more to the left might have resolved this.  But the story it shows...<br/>The closed door is more than just a closed door here.  It expresses the vicious circle the whole world lives right now.  I hope 2014 will make turn things slowly but surely.</td>', 'Talking image, but the building''s a bit crooked and goes down hill :)A few steps more to the left might have resolved this.  But the story it shows...The closed door is more than just a closed door here.  It expresses the vicious circle the whole world lives right now.  I hope 2014 will make turn things slowly but surely.', '2013-08-17 08:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7088666, 1079331, 28427, '<td valign="top">Ouch - those handcuffs must be painful.  Overall perfectly executed image with a touch of humour.</td>', 'Ouch - those handcuffs must be painful.  Overall perfectly executed image with a touch of humour.', '2013-08-17 09:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
